#Step to Integrate into Project
1.Add local.properties file in root directory of charmVideoLib
2.Add libs folder in root directory of charmVideoLib
3.Add mobilertc.aar file in libs folder

##Step for upgrade charmVideoLib
1. Update the versions in build.gradle file
2. Replace the mobilertc.aar file in libs folder with new one
3. Delete the build folder
4. Rebuild the project
